        "blog_item_BaGqPJ": {
          "type": "blog_item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-03_at_9.01.11_AM_f9bec5bd-94c7-4a79-8853-6002aa077c98.jpg",
            "tag": "",
            "title": "How to choose a scent to attract the person you are completely obsessed with: the fragrance guide nobody talks about",
            "excerpt": "There is a very particular kind of chaos that happens in the 10 minutes before you\nsee someone you have been thinking about since the group chat went suspiciously\nquiet. You road test three different outfits. A decision about the trainers gets made,\nthen reversed twice. Almost nobody spares a thought for what they are actually\ngoing to smell like, which is a shame, because fragrance underpins the laws of\nattraction more than anyone gives it credit for.",
            "link": "shopify://blogs/news/how-to-choose-a-scent-to-attract-the-person-you-are-completely-obsessed-with-the-fragrance-guide-nobody-talks-about",
